---
import { type BaseSectionProps } from '../../types/components';

interface Props extends BaseSectionProps {}
const { id = "why-remote" } = Astro.props;
---

<section id={id} class="bg-white py-12 lg:py-16 border-t border-slate-100">
  <div class="section-container">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-widest mb-8 text-center">No conflicts. No delays. No false confidence.</h3>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Structurally conflict-free</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">
            BiP Omega does not design, build, manufacture, or finance the assets it evaluates. There are no advisory relationships that create pressure to validate what should be questioned. The conclusion serves the analysis — not the transaction.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
           <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Aligned with deal timelines</h4>
           <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">
            Technical reviews that take months are not useful for acquisition processes that close in weeks. Initial scope assessments are delivered in 48 hours. Mandate timelines are defined upfront. No scope creep.
           </p>
        </div>

        <div>
           <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">No false confidence</h4>
           <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">
            Every finding is classified: Verified, Assumed, or Critical Silence. If the evidence does not support a conclusion, that is documented — not buried in footnotes. You receive an honest technical picture, not a reassuring one.
           </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
